        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Customer Use Case Diagram\n\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; VISUAL STYLE - Draw.io-like / UML scannable\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam ArrowColor #333333\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\n\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 13\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 11\n}\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 15\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam stereotype {\n    FontColor #555555\n    FontSize 10\n}\n\nskinparam note {\n    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5\n    BorderColor #888888\n    FontColor #333333\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; ACTORS - LEFT SIDE\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nactor \&quot;Guest\&quot; as Guest\n\nactor \&quot;Customer\&quot; as Customer\n\n&#39; Customer inherits from Guest\nCustomer --|&gt; Guest\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; SECONDARY ACTORS - RIGHT SIDE\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nactor \&quot;Email Service\\n(SMTP / Nodemailer)\&quot; as EmailService\n\nactor \&quot;Payment Gateway\&quot; as PaymentGateway\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; SYSTEM BOUNDARY\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nrectangle \&quot;HomeMart\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; LEFT COLUMN - CUSTOMER USE CASES\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-06&lt;/b&gt;\\nReset Forgotten Password\&quot; as UC06\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-04&lt;/b&gt;\\nManage Personal Profile &amp; Addresses\&quot; as UC04\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-05&lt;/b&gt;\\nChange Own Password\&quot; as UC05\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-10&lt;/b&gt;\\nManage Shopping Cart\&quot; as UC10\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-14&lt;/b&gt;\\nPlace Customer Order\&quot; as UC14\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-15&lt;/b&gt;\\nProcess Online Payment\&quot; as UC15\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-17&lt;/b&gt;\\nCancel Eligible Own Order\&quot; as UC17\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-16&lt;/b&gt;\\nView Own Orders and Tracking\&quot; as UC16\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-30&lt;/b&gt;\\nRequest Return for Own Order\&quot; as UC30\n\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; RIGHT SIDE - LOGIN\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-02&lt;/b&gt;\\nLogin\&quot; as UC02\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; CUSTOMER ASSOCIATIONS\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nCustomer -- UC06\nCustomer -- UC04\nCustomer -- UC05\nCustomer -- UC10\nCustomer -- UC14\nCustomer -- UC15\nCustomer -- UC17\nCustomer -- UC16\nCustomer -- UC30\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; INCLUDE RELATIONSHIPS\n&#39; All authenticated customer use cases include Login\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nUC06 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC04 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC10 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC15 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC17 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC16 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC30 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; SECONDARY ACTOR ASSOCIATIONS\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nUC06 -- EmailService : password reset email\n\nUC15 -- PaymentGateway : online payment\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rMIbhrMEplQ1qLSuvdvz-128">
