        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Staff Use Case Diagram\n\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; VISUAL STYLE - Draw.io-like / UML scannable\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam ArrowColor #333333\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\n\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 13\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor white\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 11\n}\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA\n    BorderColor #333333\n    FontColor #222222\n    FontSize 15\n    FontStyle bold\n}\n\nskinparam stereotype {\n    FontColor #555555\n    FontSize 10\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; PRIMARY ACTOR\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nactor \&quot;Staff\&quot; as Staff\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; SYSTEM BOUNDARY\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nrectangle \&quot;HomeMart\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; LEFT COLUMN - STAFF USE CASES\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-05&lt;/b&gt;\\nChange Own Password\&quot; as UC05\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-18&lt;/b&gt;\\nView and Search Sales Orders\&quot; as UC18\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-19&lt;/b&gt;\\nConfirm Sales Order\&quot; as UC19\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-20&lt;/b&gt;\\nSell Products at Counter\&quot; as UC20\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-21&lt;/b&gt;\\nFulfill and Dispatch Order\&quot; as UC21\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-22&lt;/b&gt;\\nRecord Delivery Outcome\&quot; as UC22\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-24&lt;/b&gt;\\nView Inventory Overview\&quot; as UC24\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-29&lt;/b&gt;\\nReceive Stock against Purchase Order\&quot; as UC29\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-31&lt;/b&gt;\\nCreate In-Store Return Request\&quot; as UC31\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-32&lt;/b&gt;\\nInspect and Review Return Request\&quot; as UC32\n\n\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n    &#39; RIGHT SIDE - LOGIN\n    &#39; -----------------------------------------------------\n\n    usecase \&quot;&lt;b&gt;UC-02&lt;/b&gt;\\nLogin\&quot; as UC02\n}\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; STAFF ASSOCIATIONS\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nStaff -- UC05\nStaff -- UC18\nStaff -- UC19\nStaff -- UC20\nStaff -- UC21\nStaff -- UC22\nStaff -- UC24\nStaff -- UC29\nStaff -- UC31\nStaff -- UC32\n\n&#39; =========================================================\n&#39; INCLUDE RELATIONSHIPS\n&#39; All authenticated staff use cases include Login\n&#39; =========================================================\n\nUC05 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC18 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC19 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC20 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC21 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC22 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC24 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC29 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC31 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC32 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rMIbhrMEplQ1qLSuvdvz-189">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="rMIbhrMEplQ1qLSuvdvz-228" parent="rMIbhrMEplQ1qLSuvdvz-189" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
